OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FDana flaunts her new ring. Marilyn
OL,7,     Fblames Leah. Levi snaps.
OL,8,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,9,     FScott's palpitations could be
OL,10,     Fatrial filrillation, so he's sent
OL,11,     Ffor an urgent ECG. Ian has pain
OL,12,     F'down below', connected to his
OL,13,     Fdiabetes. Irene gets support about
OL,14,     Fher dementia concerns.
OL,15,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,16,     FMichelle, 18-weeks pregnant, is
OL,17,     Frushed to resus with concerns over
OL,18,     Fpotential conditions. Craig, 43,
OL,19,     Fstruggles to breathe after food
OL,20,     Fbecomes lodged in his oesophagus.
